{"task_id": "HumanEval/44", "solution": "def change_base(x: int, base: int):\n    \"\"\"Change numerical base of input number x to base.\n    return string representation after the conversion.\n    base numbers are less than 10.\n    >>> change_base(8, 3)\n    '22'\n    >>> change_base(8, 2)\n    '1000'\n    >>> change_base(7, 2)\n    '111'\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return \"0\"\n\n    result = \"\"\n    is_negative = False\n    if x < 0:\n        is_negative = True\n        x = -x\n\n    while x > 0:\n        remainder = x % base\n        result = str(remainder) + result\n        x //= base\n\n    if is_negative:\n        result = \"-\" + result\n\n    return result"}
